## Input

```css
@keyframes rejected {
  from { opacity: 0; }
  @at-root (without: all) {
    .escaped { animation: rejected 200ms; }
  }
  to { opacity: 1; }
}

.after { color: red; }

@keyframes percentages {
  @at-root 50% { opacity: 0.5; }
  @at-root #{$step}% { opacity: 0.75; }
  to { opacity: 1; }
}

.after-percentage { color: blue; }

```


